OL,3,GNEWSAPolice yet to speak to Dover
OL,4,Aprotest organisers
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent Police is yet to speak to
OL,7,Forganisers of a protest which blocked
OL,8,Faccess to the Port of Dover for several
OL,9,Fhours, according to an assistant chief
OL,10,Fconstable.
OL,12,FThe demonstrators, dressed in black and
OL,13,Fwearing face coverings, were heard
OL,14,Fchanting "stop the boats" during the
OL,15,Fprotest on Saturday.
OL,17,FMore than 48 hours on, Assistant Chief
OL,18,FConstable Nigel Brookes said the force
OL,19,Fwas inviting those behind the event,
OL,20,Fwhich he said was lawful, to get in
OL,21,Ftouch.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
