OL,3,GNEWSAPolice yet to speak to Dover
OL,4,Aprotest organisers
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers have admitted not knowing
OL,7,Fabout the protest in advance, leading
OL,8,Fto accusations of a failure in
OL,9,Fintelligence-gathering.
